ces, turborepo, etc.)","status":"completed","activeForm":"Researching monorepo patterns"},{"content":"Check existing git repos and remotes","status":"completed","activeForm":"Checking git repos"},{"content":"Write background.md with findings","status":"completed","activeForm":"Writing background.md"},{"content":"Update task.md with gathered information","status":"in_progress","activeForm":"Updating task.md"}]},"timestamp":"2026-03-05T12:08:32.678Z"}
